Artifact3-D scar segmentation — browser port (src/geometry/artifact3d)
=====================================================================

This directory is a JavaScript port of the scar-segmentation algorithm of
Artifact3-D (ScarsCode/ScarsSegmentation), made via an intermediate Python
port. It is distributed under the MIT License of Artifact3-D, reproduced
below, together with the notices that apply to its parts.

Original work
-------------
Artifact3-D (https://sourceforge.net/projects/artifact3-d/), developed at the
Computerized Archaeology Laboratory, The Hebrew University of Jerusalem.
Scar segmentation MATLAB code (ScarsCode): Eitan Richardson, The Hebrew
University of Jerusalem, 2011.

