What is NOT included
--------------------
- GCO-3.0 (the multi-label graph-cut library bundled with Artifact3-D) is
  licensed for research purposes only. None of its code is ported, copied or
  shipped here; the graph-cut stage is an independent Potts alpha-expansion.
- Kolmogorov's maxflow library and PyMaxflow (GPL) are not used or copied;
  maxflow.js is an independent implementation of the published
  Boykov-Kolmogorov algorithm (IEEE PAMI 26(9), 2004).
- CrestCODE (Yoshizawa et al.) is not used; crest lines are detected by
  curvature non-maximum suppression, as in the Python port.

Third-party code used at run time
---------------------------------
- meshoptimizer (decimation), Copyright (c) 2016-2026 Arseny Kapoulkine,
  MIT License (npm package "meshoptimizer").

numpyRandom.js reimplements numpy's SeedSequence / PCG64 / bounded-integer
algorithms (numpy: BSD-3-Clause; PCG: M.E. O'Neill) from their published
descriptions so the clustering seeds match the Python port.

